  },
  {
    "key": "props",
    "name": "Common properties",
    "blurb": "Color, type, units, borders",
    "cards": [
      {
        "title": "Color and background",
        "body": "`color` sets the text color. `background` paints behind the content and padding. Try combinations — some aren’t readable.",
        "demo": {
          "base": "display:grid;place-items:center;",
          "kids": [
            {
              "s": "padding:16px 24px;border-radius:12px;font-size:22px;font-weight:700;border:2px solid #E4DFD4;",
              "t": "Readable?"
            }
          ],
          "knobs": [
            {
              "prop": "color",
              "opts": [
                "#1D1B26",
                "#FFFFFF",
                "#4338CA"
              ],
              "target": 0,
              "sel": ".badge",
              "start": 0
            },
            {
              "prop": "background",
              "opts": [
                "#FFFFFF",
                "#4338CA",
                "#FCD34D"
              ],
              "target": 0,
              "sel": ".badge",
              "start": 2
            }
          ]
        },
        "tip": "Keep contrast high: body text needs at least 4.5:1 against its background (3:1 for large text)."
      },
      {
        "title": "Typography",
        "body": "Three properties do most of the work: `font-size` for scale, `font-weight` for emphasis, `text-align` for alignment.",
        "demo": {
          "base": "display:flex;align-items:center;",
          "kids": [
            {
              "s": "width:100%;line-height:1.3;",
              "t": "The quick brown fox jumps."
            }
          ],
          "knobs": [
            {
              "prop": "font-size",
              "opts": [
                "14px",
                "20px",
                "28px"
              ],
              "target": 0,
              "sel": ".title",
              "start": 1
            },
            {
              "prop": "font-weight",
              "opts": [
                "400",
                "500",
                "700"
              ],
              "target": 0,
              "sel": ".title",
              "start": 2
            },
            {
              "prop": "text-align",
              "opts": [
                "left",
                "center",
                "right"
              ],
              "target": 0,
              "sel": ".title",
              "start": 0
            }
          ]
        },
        "tip": "Fewer sizes, used consistently, look more polished than many. Pick a small scale and stick to it."
      },
      {
        "title": "Units: px, %, rem",
        "body": "`px` is fixed. `%` is relative to the parent. `rem` is relative to the root font size — usually 16px, so `10rem` is 160px.",
        "demo": {
          "base": "display:flex;flex-direction:column;",
          "kids": [
            {
              "s": "background:#4338CA;color:#FFFFFF;font-weight:700;font-size:15px;border-radius:8px;padding:10px 14px;text-align:center;text-align:left;white-space:nowrap;",
              "t": "bar"
            }
          ],
          "knobs": [
            {
              "prop": "width",
              "opts": [
                "120px",
                "50%",
                "100%",
                "10rem"
              ],
              "target": 0,
              "sel": ".bar",
              "start": 1
            }
          ]
        },
        "tip": "Use `rem` for font sizes so text respects the reader’s browser settings. Use `%` when something should follow its container."
      },
      {
        "title": "Borders and corners",
        "body": "`border` takes a width, a style and an optional color. `border-radius` rounds the corners — a huge value makes a pill.",
        "demo": {
          "base": "display:grid;place-items:center;",
          "kids": [
            {
              "s": "padding:12px 24px;background:#FFFFFF;font-weight:700;font-size:16px;color:#1D1B26;",
              "t": "Button"
            }
          ],
          "knobs": [
            {
              "prop": "border",
              "opts": [
                "none",
                "2px solid",
                "4px dashed"
              ],
              "target": 0,
              "sel": ".btn",
              "start": 1
            },
            {
              "prop": "border-radius",
              "opts": [
                "0",
                "12px",
                "999px"
              ],
              "target": 0,
              "sel": ".btn",
              "start": 1
            }
          ]
        },
        "tip": "Leave out the border color and it uses the text color (`currentColor`), so borders follow your text automatically."
      }
    ]
  }
